---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="RackNerd Review - VPSTier.com" description="RackNerd offers incredibly affordable VPS hosting starting at $1.99/mo. Perfect for beginners and budget projects with reliable uptime.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/vps" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-orange-500 text-sm mb-6 block">← Back to VPS Reviews</a>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-start justify-between mb-8">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">RackNerd Review</h1>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
          <span>Commission: <strong class="text-orange-500">$50-100/sale</strong></span>
          <span>Cookie: <strong>90 days</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="noopener" 
         class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
        Visit RackNerd →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.0/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">RackNerd is a budget-friendly VPS provider offering incredibly low prices starting at $1.99/mo. Popular among developers for personal projects, VPN setups, and test environments.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $1.99/mo</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Starting at $1.99/mo (lowest in industry)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Multiple US datacenter locations</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Full root access and KVM virtualization</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Weekly and monthly backups available</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ DDoS protection included</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instances</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Limited managed services</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No sRGB-compatible storage</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Support can be slower during peak</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8">
      <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="block text-center bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold transition">
        Sign Up via Our Affiliate Link ($50-100/sale)
      </a>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mt-3">
        We earn a commission when you sign up through our link. This doesn't affect our review.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
